00:37:15.567 --> 00:37:17.653
(MOANS)

00:37:17.694 --> 00:37:18.612
(KNIFE SLASHING)

00:37:34.252 --> 00:37:35.587
(CHILDREN LAUGHING)

00:37:36.922 --> 00:37:38.132
-My turn!

00:37:36.922 --> 00:37:38.132
-Here, catch it!

00:37:38.174 --> 00:37:39.299
(GIGGLING)

00:37:39.341 --> 00:37:40.258
Mine!

00:37:46.598 --> 00:37:48.266
(LAUGHING CONTINUES)

00:37:54.397 --> 00:37:55.691
Ivar, do you want to play?

00:38:02.739 --> 00:38:03.740
CHILD: Got it!

00:38:06.785 --> 00:38:07.995
CHILD: It's mine,

00:38:06.785 --> 00:38:07.995
give it back!

00:38:09.579 --> 00:38:10.372
Now you go!

00:38:11.874 --> 00:38:13.291
CHILD: Here! To me!

00:38:18.714 --> 00:38:19.548
Throw it!

00:38:20.257 --> 00:38:21.299
Here!

00:38:21.758 --> 00:38:22.718
Give it here!

00:38:26.889 --> 00:38:28.640
-Not to him.

00:38:26.889 --> 00:38:28.640
-CHILD: No, you...

00:38:28.682 --> 00:38:29.766
Higher!

00:38:31.685 --> 00:38:33.562
My turn!

00:38:33.603 --> 00:38:34.354
To me!

00:38:41.028 --> 00:38:42.445
Come on! Here!

00:38:48.744 --> 00:38:50.328
(STRAINING)

00:38:54.875 --> 00:38:55.918
(GRUNTING)

00:38:59.629 --> 00:39:00.881
(GROANS)

00:39:00.923 --> 00:39:01.840
(CHILDREN SCREAMING)

00:39:05.761 --> 00:39:06.595
(SCREAMING)

00:39:09.932 --> 00:39:10.891
Do not be afraid.

00:39:11.975 --> 00:39:13.227
It's not your fault.

00:39:13.269 --> 00:39:14.352
(WHISPERS)

00:39:13.269 --> 00:39:14.352
Everything is all right.

00:39:18.356 --> 00:39:20.067
Everything will be all right.

00:39:23.112 --> 00:39:24.362
