00:39:37.793 --> 00:39:39.461
(WOMEN CHATTERING)

00:39:39.502 --> 00:39:41.213
(MUSIC PLAYING)

00:39:43.673 --> 00:39:45.175
(WOMEN LAUGHING)

00:40:09.866 --> 00:40:10.951
What is that?

00:40:13.829 --> 00:40:15.205
Can I see?

00:40:19.126 --> 00:40:20.543
Where did you find this?

00:40:20.585 --> 00:40:21.753
I took it from someone.

00:40:23.046 --> 00:40:23.922
Why are you so interested?

00:40:27.050 --> 00:40:28.177
I want to talk to you.

00:40:28.885 --> 00:40:30.095
What about?

00:40:31.680 --> 00:40:32.681
Us.

00:40:34.350 --> 00:40:37.102
We have moments

00:40:34.350 --> 00:40:37.102
when I feel so close to you,

00:40:37.144 --> 00:40:39.896
especially when

00:40:37.144 --> 00:40:39.896
you're inside me, but then

00:40:37.144 --> 00:40:39.896
you don't want to talk,

00:40:39.938 --> 00:40:41.398
and I wonder why

00:40:39.938 --> 00:40:41.398
you really came for me

00:40:41.439 --> 00:40:43.275
and took me away

00:40:41.439 --> 00:40:43.275
from my child.

00:40:46.945 --> 00:40:48.364
(CHUCKLES)

00:40:50.740 --> 00:40:51.700
Torvi.

00:40:57.789 --> 00:40:58.790
I talk to you.

00:41:16.433 --> 00:41:17.517
By the way,

00:41:18.852 --> 00:41:20.187
that was Erlendur's ring.

00:41:20.229 --> 00:41:21.813
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

00:41:24.649 --> 00:41:26.109
He got it from his father,

00:41:24.649 --> 00:41:26.109
King Horik.

00:41:39.248 --> 00:41:40.498
(INDISTINCT CONVERSATIONS)

00:42:08.693 --> 00:42:12.281
You look... Lagertha,

00:42:08.693 --> 00:42:12.281
you look so beautiful.

00:42:16.534 --> 00:42:18.328
This is always how I imagined

00:42:16.534 --> 00:42:18.328
this moment.

00:42:20.080 --> 00:42:22.207
Wherever I am,

00:42:22.249 --> 00:42:24.876
I don't ever want to forget

00:42:22.249 --> 00:42:24.876
how you looked on

00:42:22.249 --> 00:42:24.876
